<title>USA: Comdisco backs $2/share FY96 EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>Comdisco backs $2/share FY96 EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc said it is comfortable with earnings estimates of $2.00 a share for its fiscal year 1996, which ends Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are comfortable with those numbers,&quot; Nicholas Pontikes, executive vice president, said in an interview on Monday.  </p>
<p>In fiscal 1995, the company reported earnings of $1.73 a share.</p>
<p>Comdisco, which leases high-tech equipment and provides disaster recovery services, said it expects to report fourth quarter and fiscal 1996 earnings on November 6, before the market opens.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
